      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is this not simply what happens if you request both LOW_LATENCY and HIGH_BANDWIDTH as separate capabilities? AIUI there\u0027s no rule limiting a network request to a single capability. If these capabilities don\u0027t work together, then I think we have a bigger problem.",
