      "writtenOn": "2022-01-19T04:54:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "initial idea was to make it look like a standalone capability. Problem with allowing this to be added capability is that users can request with ENTERPRISE+HIGH_BANDWIDTH. But we can always document and add check for the same. I will check internally on how the semantics should be taken forward and based upon that decide whether to stick with current one or not",
